From de1f73c65112f907d557f8fe264db40a72664e6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Bates <help@batesai.org>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 10:59:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Serve the Subject Mastery player at /subjectmastery/

The player is built by the subject-mastery repo into
~/Downloads/subject-mastery-build/dist and staged into
public/subjectmastery/ at deploy time by scripts/stage_subjectmastery.sh,
the same arrangement as public/play/: gitignored, reproducible from its
own repo. The script refuses a build without index.html, one containing
symlinks, any file over Cloudflare Pages' 25 MiB limit, or more than
15,000 files.

Adds /subjectmastery/ to the sitemap.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
